From 08272a030fd8ce6d417f54ab7a1a757bc7238f06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:47:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [games] Add more details to a game's info tag

A game's info tag had nowhere to keep the details a library or a
plugin knows about a game beyond its title, platform, genres and
companies. Add its original title, rating, players, age rating, trailer
and tags, with Python setters and getters on InfoTagGame. Answer the
ListItem labels a skin already uses for films (OriginalTitle, Rating,
Trailer and Tag) plus new ListItem.Players and ListItem.AgeRating, and
sort a game list by rating and original title.
